{"articleNo":"682","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=682&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"인터넷디스크 회원삭제 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.03.05","hit":"16801","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #494949\">인터넷디스크 회원삭제 안내</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #494949\"></span></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"COLOR: #494949\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">&nbsp;* </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">인터넷 디스크의 회원자격은 재학생<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>재직중인 교직원으로 <span class=\"GramE\">하고<span lang=\"EN-US\"> &nbsp;</span>있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span>따라서<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: teal\">제적생<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span>졸업생과 <span class=\"SpellE\">재직중이</span> 아닌 교직원은 부득이 탈퇴처리</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">를 할 예정입니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">&nbsp;&nbsp;* </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">회원 자격을 상실하는 회원께서는 필요한 자료를 백업하시기 바라며<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span>클럽운영자<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>시삽<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>는 반드시 새로운 운영자를 선정하여 주시기 바랍니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">&nbsp;&nbsp;* </span></strong><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">일괄 <span class=\"SpellE\">탈퇴처리일은</span> </span></strong><date o:ls=\"trans\" year=\"2009\" month=\"4\" day=\"6\" w:st=\"on\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red\">2009</span></strong><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red\">년<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 4</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 06</span>일</span></strong></date><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">입니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue\">※ 탈퇴처리 후 자료는 복구 할 수 없음</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue\"></span></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 27.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949; FONT-FAMILY: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore\">l<span style=\"FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">학부졸업생 중 본교 대학원 신입생인 경우 관리자<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>아래연락처<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>에게 연락 또는 </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 27.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 연장신청 메일<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>성명<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>학부학번<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>대학원학번<span lang=\"EN-US\">, e-mail, </span>연락처<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>을 보내 주시면 기존 </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 27.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 인터넷디스크를 그대로 이용하실 수 있도록 조치해 드리겠습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">&nbsp;* </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">인터넷디스크관련 <span class=\"GramE\">기타문의<span lang=\"EN-US\"> :</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> 054)478-7196, <a href=\"mailto:nalkii@kumoh.ac.kr\">nalkii@kumoh.ac.kr</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><date o:ls=\"trans\" year=\"2009\" month=\"3\" day=\"4\" w:st=\"on\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\">2009.03.04</span></date></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><date o:ls=\"trans\" year=\"2009\" month=\"3\" day=\"4\" w:st=\"on\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #494949\"></span></date>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
